<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Analytics</h1>
<p>UTMPro provides real-time analytics for every link you create.</p>

<h2>Dashboard Overview</h2>
<p>The analytics dashboard shows: total clicks, unique clicks, leads, revenue, and a time-series chart of clicks over time.</p>

<h2>Time Ranges</h2>
<p>Filter analytics by: 1 hour, 24 hours, 7 days, 30 days, 90 days, or 1 year. Analytics retention depends on your plan.</p>

<h2>Breakdowns</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Click Map</strong> — Visual country-level breakdown with flag emojis</li>
    <li><strong>Devices</strong> — Desktop, Mobile, Tablet distribution chart</li>
    <li><strong>Browsers</strong> — Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge breakdown</li>
    <li><strong>Operating Systems</strong> — Windows, macOS, iOS, Android, Linux</li>
    <li><strong>Referrers</strong> — Where clicks are coming from</li>
    <li><strong>Top Links</strong> — Your best-performing links</li>
</ul>

<h2>Conversion Funnel</h2>
<p>Visualize your conversion path: Clicks → Leads → Sales, with conversion rates at each step.</p>

<h2>Public Stats</h2>
<p>Share a public analytics page with advertisers or partners via <code>/stats/{linkExternalId}</code>.</p>

<h2>Analytics Retention</h2>
<table>
    <tr><th>Plan</th><th>Retention</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Free</td><td>30 days</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Pro</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Business</td><td>3 years</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Advanced</td><td>5 years</td></tr>
</table></div>
